        <ownedComment xmi:type="uml:Comment" xmi:id="_apKgAicmEfCmi6S6HBBkKg">
          <body>Root (abstract) class of the errors that can be attached to a MA?GO property. The class inherit from \texttt{meas:uncertainty} in order to be usable in the context of properties based on \texttt{Measures} classes.
